WEBVTT

00:07:59.593 --> 00:08:00.743
Just a few.

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:02.296
But in the pursuit,

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:06.533
I became the first black woman
to ever become the nominee for governor

00:08:06.557 --> 00:08:10.034
in the history of the United States
of America for a major party.

00:08:10.612 --> 00:08:14.617
(Cheers)

00:08:14.653 --> 00:08:18.643
(Applause)

00:08:18.839 --> 00:08:21.458
But more importantly, in this process,

00:08:21.482 --> 00:08:25.744
we turned out 1.2 million
African American voters in Georgia.

00:08:25.768 --> 00:08:26.991
That is more voters

00:08:27.015 --> 00:08:30.934
than voted on the Democratic side
of the ticket in 2014.